{"id":"n71228-1-9","stage":2,"title":"저자 · 著者","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71228-1-9-1","ko":"이 책 정말 재미있다. 누가 쓴 작품이지?","zh":"这本书真的很好看。是谁写的作品呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미있다.","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓴","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작품이지?","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]}],"audio":"/audio/3601ed67d5b589e5b789.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71228-1-9-2","ko":"맨 앞장에 저자 소개가 있어.","zh":"最前面有作者简介。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맨","meaning":"最，头","explanation":"맨：最，头","readings":[{"term":"맨","audio":"/audio/7ec4b331b5617833973d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65109","senseId":"1","lemma":"맨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞장에","meaning":"前头；章，章节","explanation":"앞：前头；장：章，章节；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"},{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"2","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73814","senseId":"2","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저자","meaning":"著者，作者","explanation":"저자：著者，作者","readings":[{"term":"저자","audio":"/audio/d94f6e0b3d225b02f46c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71228","senseId":"1","lemma":"저자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소개가","meaning":"介绍","explanation":"소개：介绍；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소개","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64301","senseId":"3","lemma":"소개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ec4b331b5617833","term":"맨","zh":"最，头","audio":"/audio/7ec4b331b5617833973d.mp3","entryId":"65109","definition":"第一，无比的。","pronunciation":["맨ː"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前头","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"次序靠前的地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"2dfdb434387c361c","term":"장","zh":"章，章节","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3","entryId":"73814","definition":"数划分文章内容的计量单位。","pronunciation":["장"]},{"id":"d94f6e0b3d225b02","term":"저자","zh":"著者，作者","audio":"/audio/d94f6e0b3d225b02f46c.mp3","entryId":"71228","definition":"写文章或书的人。","pronunciation":["저ː자"]},{"id":"7367283c48b6e4d5","term":"소개","zh":"介绍","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3","entryId":"64301","definition":"对不熟悉或不知道的事实或内容进行的说明。","pronunciation":["소개"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/49b9551bd001b8dfb582.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.437,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71228","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最前面有作者简介。","听说承奎终于在三年后找到工作了。","这本书真的很好看。是谁写的作品呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"opt